  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the injured woman as the embodiment of the 'why' behind women's demands for equal rights",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman with injuries, as the meme frames her suffering as the direct reason for the demand for equal rights. The text 'and this is why' explicitly directs the viewer to interpret the woman's trauma as the causal explanation, thereby projecting the user's perspective onto her as the symbolic representation of the justification for women's rights activism. This projection is reinforced by the direct gaze of the woman, which creates an implicit connection between the viewer and the subject of suffering.",
